{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">熱播劇集《死有對証》中，強迫症女法醫程芷昕（陳曉華飾）經常遭「毒舌上司」林琛（韋家雄飾）處處刁難，兩人火花不斷。這對歡喜冤家更將劇中的人設延伸至互聯網，合作拍攝了一共三集的小劇場短片《強迫症的一天》，以番外篇的形式繼續演活角色，大放笑彈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"59925ed8-410f-4cb6-b4d3-cb1068a05307.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026V9uPjOazKH1789120914.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"59925ed8-410f-4cb6-b4d3-cb1068a05307.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">早前播出的劇集中，芷昕剛從死者胃部取出「乾炒牛河」，中午隨即被上司整蠱請食同款食物，令不少觀眾看完直呼「無法直視乾炒牛河」！而這次《強迫症的一天》第一彈，便以兩人惹笑的「薯條大戰」揭開序幕。片中陳曉華強迫症發作，神情專注地拿著小鑷子，將盤中的薯條逐條整齊排列，再小心翼翼地夾起沾茄汁享用。韋家雄端著另一盤薯條坐到對面，見狀忍不住吐糟：「呢個鉗係用嚟掹鼻毛㗎，你用嚟排薯條啊？」陳曉華則一臉認真地反駁：「我呢個鉗呢，係攞嚟尊重食物㗎！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"eea0a62c-a5df-4237-b701-4be0a9da9c88.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ig7RS9yvq81789120914.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"eea0a62c-a5df-4237-b701-4be0a9da9c88.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d5f52d4f-7155-4236-931d-75794a186fae.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026wT5EbJKfrh1789120913.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d5f52d4f-7155-4236-931d-75794a186fae.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨後，韋家雄將整支茄汁狂擠在自己的薯條上，令陳曉華當場傻眼兼心痛，直指這樣會把薯條「浸死晒」。韋家雄繼續發揮毒舌本色神回：「炸嗰陣時已經死晒啦，而家先嚟浸死？」說罷便徒手抓起大把沾滿茄汁的薯條塞入口中，吃得津津有味兼連手指都吮乾淨。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9900bbda-4915-4d48-a7a5-af05c424ae46.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202608244oa7de1789120913.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9900bbda-4915-4d48-a7a5-af05c424ae46.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">短片尾聲，意猶未盡的韋家雄竟然將「魔爪」伸向陳曉華的盤中，嚇得對方驚聲尖叫：「我排得好辛苦㗎！」兩人幽默的互動喜感爆燈，短片最後更以搞笑標籤「#請尊重薯條」作結，令網民捧腹大笑。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T08:18:24.750869+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":544,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}